Package: gridpin
Title: Offline Geocoding with One File per Country
Version: 0.6.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("GridPin", email = "contact@gridpin.dev", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Authors of the dependency Rust crates", role = c("aut", "cph"),
           comment = "see inst/AUTHORS"))
Description: Geocodes addresses and reverse-geocodes coordinates on the local
    machine, without a server, an API key or a network request per address.
    Each country is one memory-mapped file built from Overture Maps and open
    address registers, downloaded once and verified against the release
    checksums. Answers carry their precision (house, street, city) and a
    confidence score, so uncertain matches can be checked before use.
License: Apache License (== 2.0)
URL: https://gridpin.dev, https://github.com/gridpin/gridpin
BugReports: https://github.com/gridpin/gridpin/issues
Depends: R (>= 4.2.0)
